 "intro": {
  "@es": "En una historia se mezclan dos cosas: lo que pasaba de fondo (imperfetto) y lo que ocurrió (passato remoto). Es la forma clásica de contar cuentos y noticias.",
  "@en": "In one story two things are mixed: what was going on in the background (imperfect) and what happened (remote passage). It's the classic way to tell stories and news."
 }
